License: MPL-2.0
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Ghostery's embeddable EasyList/uBlock-compatible filtering engine. Focus
Browser consumes only the platform-independent @ghostery/adblocker core; the
Ghostery extension UI and product are not included.

Local Modifications:
The upstream npm module and its transitive dependencies are bundled without
source modifications. src/focus_ghostery_adblocker.js is a Focus-owned,
browser-compatible adapter that exposes JSON-safe initialization, request
matching, serialization and cosmetic-filter entry points. Advanced scriptlet,
HTML, CSP and extended-selector behavior is disabled by the adapter defaults.

Update Mechanism:
Update UPSTREAM.json and the exact dependency in package.json, regenerate the
npm lock file, run `npm ci`, then run `npm run verify`. Never build from an
unlocked dependency tree and never fetch filter assets from a mutable upstream
branch at browser runtime.
